  "details": "The current VRC client lacks any support for deaf/hard of hearing users. \nNo support for users who rely on adaptive controllers to deal with physical disability. \nNot even the most bare basic of colorblind filters has so much as been ATTEMPTED to be implemented\nThere is no options for text chat, tts, or closed captioning.\nNot adding so much as a colorblind filter and text chat before implementing a sweeping block on all mods is a massive spit in the face to the disabled members of your community.",
